### The fetch demo: read the complete feed from start to end (low-level fetch API)
GET http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/fetch

### Status of the handler feeds
GET http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/feeds

### Activate the full-monty feed (processes the backlog immediately)
PUT http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/feeds/full-monty/activate

### Deactivate the full-monty feed (a run in progress stops after the next commit point)
PUT http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/feeds/full-monty/deactivate

### Activate the simple-processing feed (processes the backlog in batches)
PUT http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/feeds/simple-processing/activate
Content-Type: application/json

### Deactivate the simple-processing feed
PUT http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/feeds/simple-processing/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json

### Deactivate/activate the simple feed
PUT http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/feeds/simple/deactivate

###
PUT http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/feeds/simple/activate

### Push a standalone content item onto the full-monty feed (the EntryPusher building block)
POST http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/rest/demo/feeds/full-monty/push
Content-Type: application/json

{"aField": "recovered-042"}

### View the raw source feed (head; note: every head poll adds an entry)
GET http://localhost:14220/atomium-client-core-demo/demo-feed
